---
title: "Introduction to Information Systems"
code: "ITE-100"
category: "information-technology-essentials"
credits: "3"
prerequisites: []
corequisites: []
---

Covers the fundamentals of computers and computing and topics which include impact of computers on society, ethical issues, and terminology. Provides discussion about available hardware and software as well as their application. Lecture 3 hours per week.
